ier</surname><given-names>P-E</given-names></name><name><surname>Raoult</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title><italic>rpoB</italic> gene sequence-based identification of aerobic Gram-positive cocci of the genera <italic>Streptococci, Enterococcus, Gemmela, Abiotrophia, and Granulicatella</italic></article-title><source>J Clin Microbiol</source><year>2004</year><volume>42</volume><fpage>497</fpage><lpage>504</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14766807</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R16"><label>16</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gauduchon</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Chalabreysse</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Etienne</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Molecular diagnosis of infective endocarditis by PCR amplification and direct sequencing of DNA from valve tissue</article-title><source>J Clin Microbiol</source><year>2003</year><volume>41</volume><fpage>763</fpage><lpage>6</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12574279</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R17"><label>17</label><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lepp</surname><given-names>PW</given-names></name><name><surname>Relman</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name></person-group><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Persing</surname><given-names>DH</given-names></name><name><surname>Tenover</surname><given-names>FC</given-names></name><name><surname>Versalovic</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Molecular phylogenetic analysis </article-title><source>(Chapter 13) Molecular Microbiology Diagnostic Principles and Practice</source><year>2004</year><publisher-loc>Washington DC</publisher-loc><publisher-name>ASM Press</publisher-name></citation></ref></ref-list></back><floats-wrap><table-wrap id="T1" p